Package: tinyVanR
Type: Package
Title: A Lightweight, Reactive Web Framework for R powered by CivetWeb
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Vedo", "Alagic", email = "vedo.alagic@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R interface to the CivetWeb embedded C web server designed for 
    building lightweight, reactive web applications. It facilitates
    communication between R and frontend frameworks like VanJS, supporting 
    static file serving and dynamic JSON request handling.
